/******************************************************************************
* djinterp [re_std]                                                   typeinfo
*
* typeinfo umbrella header:
*   Aggregates the granular per-symbol headers under
* /inc/djinterp/re_std/typeinfo/. Mirrors the standard <typeinfo> header.
* The whole module is a strategic re-export: type_info, bad_cast, and
* bad_typeid are compiler-and-runtime-provided RTTI types that cannot be
* reimplemented portably, so re_std surfaces the std types in-namespace
* via identity-preserving using-declarations. This umbrella adds no
* symbols of its own.
*
*   PORTABILITY:
*   Every symbol is C++98 baseline, gated on D_ENV_CPP98_HAS_TYPEINFO
* (RTTI availability). On a -fno-rtti build the module expands to
* nothing. type_info::hash_code() (C++11) and the C++23 constant-
* evaluation support for type_info comparisons ride along from the std
* type with no re_std involvement.
*
*
* TABLE OF CONTENTS
* =================
* I.    type_info
* II.   bad_cast
* III.  bad_typeid
*
*
* path:      /inc/djinterp/re_std/typeinfo/typeinfo
* link(s):   TBA
* author(s): Samuel 'teer' Neal-Blim                       created: 2026.06.04
******************************************************************************/

